# Paths the SAST gate skips. Semgrep already scans only git-tracked files, so
# node_modules / build output are excluded by .gitignore; these are the extras.
#
# Tests: they deliberately contain the insecure patterns they assert against
# (e.g. pg.test.ts checks that the default TLS mode is rejectUnauthorized:false
# for Render's self-signed internal certificates). Scanning them only produces
# findings about the assertions themselves.
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.rntest.tsx
**/__tests__/

# Design-system mockups and handoff bundles: static prototype HTML/JS that never
# ships (the site and app are the ported code under apps/).
Zeno Design System/
Zeno Design System-handoff/

# Generated / vendored
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
apps/mobile/android/
apps/mobile/ios/
